onths after being  decapitated Mike became so well known  that he taught across the country with  people paying money to get a look at him  and I think this plays into why Bucky  wears a bow tie because generally  speaking bow ties can be associated with  animals who are being put on show final  thing to mention about the chicken devil  is that he was self-aware to the point  where he refused to eat fried chicken  and he also expressed the fear of being  eaten himself next up we have princi the  spider devil who's a hunter working for  the Japanese government alongside denji  power and the rest of special division  IV considering that fear of spiders is a  relatively common phobia princey is  shown to be a strong Devil with some  unique abilities including the power to  teleport other people on her face she  has a zip running down the center and  when she wants to bring someone to her  location all she has to do is unzip her  body enabling them to emerge from the  gaping hole this power seems to work  regardless of the distance between  princy and the person being teleported  although from what we've seen can only  be done if both parties want it to  happen being the spider devil she  understandably has eight legs with sharp  points on the end and she can use them  to hang upside down from the ceiling  chop the heads of zombies in one go or  stab her Target from multiple angles on  top of that she can seemingly become  intangible sort of like mirio from my  hero Academia but this is something  she's only done one time as of making  this video this permeation means princy  can hide underground so that no one  knows she's there and when she's ready  she can quickly jump out and launch a  surprise attack last thing to say about  this character is that in chapter 34  Captain kushibe implied that she has  another form that looks more like a  devil but normally Prince he chooses to  look like this given that she's friendly  towards humans following this we have  the bat d