ving the long gigantic  snake body which is to be expected what  makes it so unsettling is that its mouth  is made from Human arms topped off with  these tiny teeth that kind of resemble  the xenomores from the alien franchise  when the author of Chainsaw man Fujimoto  was in the concept stage he initially  drew the snake devil to be a lot less  intimidating but given that it's meant  to be such a menacing threat it makes  sense why the horror was cranked up for  the final thing regarding the snake's  potential so far the only humanists made  a contract with this saw Atari and she's  been able to use his power in a few  different ways for example in chapter 25  she used his giant mouth to completely  swallow another strong devil comparable  to how in real life certain snakes are  able to swallow large animals like  crocodiles or even cows by eating  another devil saw Atari and the snake  then gain a degree of control over it  and in future battles the snake can  vomit it back out and make it fight for  them another thing about the snake is  that although it's incredibly fast it's  not so fast that a skilled devil Hunter  won't be able to avoid it next in line  we have the leech devil who was briefly  mentioned earlier in the video and just  like her boyfriend she ended up getting  brutally torn apart by the public safety  devil Hunters on her introduction she  had a huge body that towered over denji  completely and was strong enough to  sever his arm without even really trying  just like the bat she had an inherent  hatred for all humans on Earth but  interestingly she was willing to let her  boyfriend's killer Go free just because  he had a good looking face to me this  shows that she clearly wasn't on the  same level when it came to his ruthless  mindset considering that he did this to  power just because he gave him some bad  blood on that topic the leech devil also  didn't mind consuming denji's hybrid  blood even though the bat devil acted  like it was the most