ick layers of bone  protecting his body and his high level  of intelligence was directly comparable  to the bad devil as an example they both  openly questioned why change the man  would side with humans instead of devils  and they each gave density a test to see  how much of a hero he really is in the  bat Devil's case he threw a car with  someone inside only to realize that  chainsaw man didn't care about this  guy's life at all similarly the  Cockroach devil gave him the option to  save a young student with a bright  future or a car full of old men but  again okay so man didn't care about  either of them and instead he  prioritized saving a nearby cat moving  on in chapter 41 the pig devil made its  first and only appearance of the series  and the most notable thing about it is  that before Public Safety arrived the  devil had eaten a private devil Hunter  the hunter in question had his legs  ripped off but was somehow still able to  survive inside the pig's guts forcing a  reluctant Aki to put him out of his  misery lastly the praying mantis devil  has also only made one single appearance  in the manga showing up in chapter 91  after being summoned by two devil  Hunters by clasping their hands together  the matches his leg burst out of the  ground and was used to slice a nearby  devil although the agents were still  immediately killed by that devil seconds  later  with that said that completes our list  of all animal Devils that have appeared  in chainsaw man so far and if you  enjoyed this video then be sure to drop  a like and hit that sub button so you  don't miss future videos like this until  the next one peace out

